[00:02.000] 作词 : Jesper Borgen/Tommy LaVerdi/William Wiik Larsen/Andrew Frampton/James Njie/Atle Pettersen
[00:03.000] 作曲 : Alan Walker/Lars Kristian Rosness/Marcus Arnbekk/Fredrik Borch Olsen/Anders Froen/Gunnar Greve/James Njie/Jesper Borgen/Tommy Laverdi/Atle Pettersen/William Wiik Larsen/Jamie Stenzel/Andrew Frampton
[00:14.290]We’re not in love (你我从未相爱)
[00:17.140]We share no stories (也不曾有什么交集存在)
[00:19.980]Just something in your eyes (唯有你眼眸中的坚毅我甚是喜爱)
[00:25.680]Don’t be afraid (别恐惧畏怕)
[00:28.420]The shadows know me (那无边黑暗懂我的心)
[00:31.280]Let’s leave the world behind (让我们启程离开 这浩瀚人寰)
[00:36.720]Take me through the night (请携我穿越那漆黑夜幕)
[00:39.200]Fall into the dark side (纵身坠落进那无边黑暗)
[00:43.170]We don’t need the light (无需光的存在)
[00:44.730]We’ll live on the dark side (寄居在这黑暗)
[00:48.580]I see it (一同体验)
[00:49.860]Let’s feel it (一同感受)
[00:51.210]While we’re still young and fearless (在这年少轻狂的时候)
[00:53.760]Let go of the light (任凭光芒摇曳消散)
